	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Heri literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11566">Nr. 1523</ref>.</note> ad te dedi, pater colendissime, e quibus facile <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>omnia ea percipere licet, quę hic memoratu digna aguntur; nunc vero, cum <persName ref="p3590">principis</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostri abitum celeriorem<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> celeriorem <hi>gestrichenes</hi> brevio.</note> fore, quam putarim, intelligam, consilium petiturus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>denuo ad te scribere coactus sum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ante dies enim aliquot nuntii <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l311">Marpurgum</placeName><pb type="edition" next="208"/> dimissi sunt, qui equos a <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbona</placeName> ante remissos reducant, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ita ut princeps inter decimum octavum diem discessum moliatur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hic <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quid mihi facto opus sit, a<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor a gestrichenes</hi> an[?].</note> nostris consuleretur, velim.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>certe <persName ref="p4082">legati</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> wurde am <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Reichstag durch <persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName> vertreten; s. <hi>Moeller,</hi> Zwick 222-224; vgl. oben <ref target="file11535">Nr. 1492</ref>, Anm. 19.</note> cum diutius et ad <persName ref="p18538">cęsaris</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> fortassis discessum usque <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hic moraturi sint, vix contingere poterit, ut eorum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Vor</hi> eorum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> hic.</note> profectionem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>expectem, nisi nostri magno me sumptu hic sustentare velint, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod tamen, cur faciant, operaepretium esse non video, si hi discesserint, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quorum consortio de principum et imperii negotiis certior fieri poteram.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Annona hic omnium est charissima.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Equum vix quinque bazonibus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>per diem alerem nec meipsum minoris.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Unde facile coniicies, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quantę hic impensae faciundę forent diutius haesuro.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quare <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>hęc in tempore significare volui, quo et in tempore a vobis consilium <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>accipiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Expectabo enim post principis discessum, quoad a vobi<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>s responsum fuerit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName> i<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>am erga nostros <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>videtur commotior.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3590">Princeps</persName> noster<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">noster <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> suam sententiam scriptis commendavit,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint ist wohl <persName ref="p3590">Philipps</persName> Instruktion vom 13. Juni für die in <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> zurückbleibenden Räte (<bibl source="b373">Lenz</bibl> III 97-105); vgl. auch Nikolaus <hi>Müller,</hi> Beiträge zur Kirchengeschichte der Mark Brandenburg im 16. Jahrhundert, Heft 1, Leipzig 1907, S. 95f (zu Corr. des réformateurs VII 158).</note> quam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hic relicturus est, cuius summam nondum videre licuit, quia paucis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ab hinc horis nostris exhibita est.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ad nostram de eucharistia sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>iam omnes sese inclinare videntur; animadvertunt enim, quam aegre <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>illorum dogma<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Gemeint ist die lutherische Abendmahlslehre.</note> asseri possit cum papistis disputando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nec iam de <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vera inter <placeName ref="l822">Germanicas</placeName> ecclesias concordia dubitandum esse video.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p2095">Philippus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p2095">Philipp Melanchthon</persName>.</note> enim eucharistiae negotium publico scripto tractaturus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>est<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Von einer entsprechenden Veröffentlichung ist nichts bekannt; der kurze Text "De abusu multiplici Sacramentorum [...]" (<bibl source="b441">MO</bibl> IV 309-316, Nr. 2238) wird kaum gemeint sein.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Et <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> a pristino rigore multum recessisse prę<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dicant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Discessit hodie <persName ref="p4572">Corvinus</persName>, cuius nomine te plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>salvere iubeo una cum reliquis symmystis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Scripsisset haud dubie, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nisi negotiorum procellis fuisset obrutus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Scribent hac septimana <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p8413">Dionysius</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8413">Dionysius Melander</persName> schrieb am 13. Juni; s. unten <ref target="file11575">Nr. 1532</ref>.</note> et <persName ref="p8331">Draconites</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Von <persName ref="p8331">Draconites</persName> liegt kein weiterer Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vor.</note>, quorum ille nunc negotiis, hic vero <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>adversa valetudine impeditur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sunt, qui Palatinum electo<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>rem<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p18548">Ludwig V.</persName>, Kurfürst von der <placeName ref="l2477">Pfalz</placeName>.</note> adventare praedicent; mihi tamen non videtur verisimile.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p2411">Otto Henrychus</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p2411">Pfalzgraf Ottheinrich</persName>.</note>, dux <placeName ref="l619">Bavariae</placeName>, hisce diebus evangelicam concionem<pb type="scan" next="398"/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>in minoritarum coenobio haberi curavit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Cresceret piorum numerus <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>indies, nisi is, a quo summa rerum pendet,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Gemeint ist der Kaiser.</note> ab hypocrisi ad ingenium <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rediisset.<pb type="edition" next="209"/></s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Deus illuminet cor eius, ut veritatem dei pur[am]<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Randtext beschnitten.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>cognoscens relictis antichristi senticetis in domini via ambulet.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> in fontibus venena repert<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>a <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sunt, author ignoratur.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Item et prata infecta esse multi suspicant[ur]<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Randtext beschnitten.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>In eadem enim urbe duodecim vaccę repentino casu et morte subitanea i<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>nter pascendum<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g">inter pascendum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> corruerunt.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Tempora certe periculosa sunt et homines <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>lubrici, pauci denique, qui aut bonum ament aut malum puniant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Salutant te fratres omnes.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvos etiam cupio <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię et scholę praesides, praeceptores meos colendissimos, imprimis <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>vero <persName ref="p7042">matrem</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14"><persName ref="p7042">Anna, geb. Wiederkehr</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p8051">uxorem</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="15"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> tuam cum omni liberorum coetu<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kindern s. oben <ref target="file11503">Nr. 1460</ref>, Anm. 121.</note> et reli<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>qua familia.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, pater mi, et <persName ref="p8011">Rodolphi</persName> tui res <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>ita, ut facis, curare pergas, obsecro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonae</placeName>, raptim, ex <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>aula illustrissimi <persName ref="p3590">Hessorum</persName> principis, pridie calendas iunii 1541.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Tui observantissimus <persName ref="p8011">Rod. Gvaltherus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de">Dem hochgelerten M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, pred<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>icanten zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z19"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, meinem insonders günstigen <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>herrn zuͦ handen.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Z[ür]ich</placeName><note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>Teilweise auf das nicht mehr vorhandene Verschlussband geschrieben.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>